    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/f4ff9ea0d8397f7ee88da86985e9ae97.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is crucial for victory. Stay agile to effectively defeat enemies and explore the world. Quick reflexes and swift maneuvers are essential for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/953674b53ab6a9a68d799b513a6a44a5.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark and dramatic story. The brutal Lazarus Legion has invaded the magical world, abducting and replacing its fierce but careless fairies, stealing their immortal souls. Humanity's leaders will pay any price to save their kind from a deadly plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/e8e8e6060242774346187c5c574c8166.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lorcan's arsenal of swords, guns, and spells into powerful combos. Deal maximum damage through chains of strikes and special moves. Develop unique strategies for each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/ae6b8ab01059a15e2dd415c82ef5cb4e.avif?t=1748294187\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lorcan, a brave fairy warrior betrayed by his kin and mutilated by humans. With nothing left but vengeance, choose your path: support the naive and quarrelsome fairies, ally with the unscrupulous Lazarus Legion, or bring wrath upon both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/4b6fc9a94d2abbaf1bd261c922505bc2.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fairy world hides many secrets. Some elements of the environment and story require deeper understanding. Meticulously explore to uncover the world's true nature and unlock hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/88cd935b06ec83ceae63ac480785b092.avif?t=1748294187\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've been working hard for over two years to bring this vision to life. Your feedback and support are invaluable, helping us refine and enhance FAIRYPUNK. Your encouragement fuels our passion and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community, share your thoughts, and help shape the future of FAIRYPUNK!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/f4ff9ea0d8397f7ee88da86985e9ae97.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is crucial for victory. Stay agile to effectively defeat enemies and explore the world. Quick reflexes and swift maneuvers are essential for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/953674b53ab6a9a68d799b513a6a44a5.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark and dramatic story. The brutal Lazarus Legion has invaded the magical world, abducting and replacing its fierce but careless fairies, stealing their immortal souls. Humanity's leaders will pay any price to save their kind from a deadly plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/e8e8e6060242774346187c5c574c8166.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Lorcan's arsenal of swords, guns, and spells into powerful combos. Deal maximum damage through chains of strikes and special moves. Develop unique strategies for each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/ae6b8ab01059a15e2dd415c82ef5cb4e.avif?t=1748294187\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lorcan, a brave fairy warrior betrayed by his kin and mutilated by humans. With nothing left but vengeance, choose your path: support the naive and quarrelsome fairies, ally with the unscrupulous Lazarus Legion, or bring wrath upon both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/4b6fc9a94d2abbaf1bd261c922505bc2.avif?t=1748294187\" width=800 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fairy world hides many secrets. Some elements of the environment and story require deeper understanding. Meticulously explore to uncover the world's true nature and unlock hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722350/extras/88cd935b06ec83ceae63ac480785b092.avif?t=1748294187\" data-has-big width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've been working hard for over two years to bring this vision to life. Your feedback and support are invaluable, helping us refine and enhance FAIRYPUNK. Your encouragement fuels our passion and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community, share your thoughts, and help shape the future of FAIRYPUNK!</p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced action slasher set in a dark fairytale. Chain sword and gun attacks, mimic enemy combat styles, and blaze through arenas with lightning speed. Reap cursed legions and corrupted fairies as you fight to save your dying world.",
